00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:04.537
He's in Aparecida this evening.

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:07.941
And Ivan, what is the latest there?

00:00:08.241 --> 00:00:09.409
Erin, Ukrainian authorities

00:00:09.409 --> 00:00:09.843
say at

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:12.879
least two people were killed in Ukraine's

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:14.414
