00:00:49.115 --> 00:00:50.750
against Ukrainian defenders

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:52.786
in this city on Ukraine's eastern front.

00:00:53.153 --> 00:00:54.788
Russian troops and mercenaries

00:00:54.788 --> 00:00:57.023
have made only incremental gains

00:00:57.791 --> 00:00:59.926
and suffered staggering losses.

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:02.062
Russian forces

00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:03.763
