00:01:12.038 --> 00:01:12.605
The enormous

00:01:12.605 --> 00:01:14.474
sacrifice Ukrainians have made

00:01:14.474 --> 00:01:15.975
in their costly defense

00:01:15.975 --> 00:01:19.345
