00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:25.885
Ukraine claims

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:27.087
the area has been hit

00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:28.922
with more than 200 strikes

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:30.757
in the last day alone.

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:31.357
And Russia

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:32.725
is sending in backup

00:01:32.725 --> 00:01:34.861
to compensate for the growing losses

00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:37.130
