00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:48.908
has not improved in such a way.

00:01:48.908 --> 00:01:50.844
We can talk about some kind of victory

00:01:50.844 --> 00:01:52.212
or anything like that.

00:01:52.212 --> 00:01:53.613
On the contrary,

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:55.415
