00:02:11.498 --> 00:02:12.132
The Ukrainian

00:02:12.132 --> 00:02:13.233
military says

00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:15.401
it's using the front lines of bark

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:18.872
to bleed and exhaust the Russian army.

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:22.008
But how long can Ukraine afford to fight

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:24.210
