00:08:56.202 --> 00:08:57.870
the world's elite

00:08:59.171 --> 00:09:00.339
met recently.

00:09:00.339 --> 00:09:00.840
The Wall Street

00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:02.241
Journal says that Putin's girlfriend,

00:09:02.241 --> 00:09:03.709
mother of his children, Elina

00:09:03.709 --> 00:09:04.176
Biver,

00:09:04.176 --> 00:09:05.444
lives in a high walled mansion

00:09:05.444 --> 00:09:06.279
near Geneva,

00:09:06.279 --> 00:09:07.947
or certainly has at one point.

00:09:07.947 --> 00:09:08.481
And Switzerland

00:09:08.481 --> 00:09:10.016
even acknowledged nearly $50

00:09:10.016 --> 00:09:11.817
billion of Russian money in Swiss banks.

00:09:11.817 --> 00:09:13.486
That's what they're acknowledging.

00:09:13.486 --> 00:09:15.555
How how big is this?

00:09:16.255 --> 00:09:19.725
I guess the safety zone, Elina?

00:09:19.725 --> 00:09:21.360
Well, exactly as you said,

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:21.794
I mean, Swiss

00:09:21.794 --> 00:09:23.963
banks in particular have a reputation

00:09:23.963 --> 00:09:25.231
and they've been quite notorious

00:09:25.231 --> 00:09:26.632
because of the kind of anonymity

00:09:26.632 --> 00:09:29.035
they provide to their clients

00:09:29.035 --> 00:09:31.904
in being known as a safe harbor for

00:09:32.138 --> 00:09:33.606
dirty money, money

00:09:33.606 --> 00:09:36.208
that is being laundered, money

00:09:36.208 --> 00:09:37.476
that is stolen in this case

00:09:37.476 --> 00:09:38.778
from the Russian people.

00:09:38.778 --> 00:09:40.112
And it's been a known fact

00:09:40.112 --> 00:09:41.647
that many Russian oligarchs

00:09:41.647 --> 00:09:44.584
who are trying to stay safe, basically,

00:09:44.717 --> 00:09:46.519
and keep their money out of the hands

00:09:46.519 --> 00:09:48.120
of their own country, of the hands of Mr.

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:49.355
Putin in particular,

00:09:49.355 --> 00:09:51.490
have been hiding it in Europe.

00:09:51.857 --> 00:09:53.225
But particularly in Switzerland,

00:09:53.225 --> 00:09:54.160
unfortunately,

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:55.628
there are many Western

00:09:55.628 --> 00:09:57.096
financial institutions

00:09:57.096 --> 00:09:58.598
that are likely involved in this.

00:09:58.598 --> 00:10:01.200
Switzerland is really the hotspot for it.

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:01.867
But I think

00:10:01.867 --> 00:10:03.269
what's really different now

00:10:03.269 --> 00:10:05.071
is that the Department of Justice

00:10:05.071 --> 00:10:06.572
is taking this very seriously

00:10:06.572 --> 00:10:09.208
in a way that we haven't seen before.

00:10:09.208 --> 00:10:11.644
And to the extent to which they're also

00:10:12.311 --> 00:10:15.114
investigating Western wealth managers

00:10:15.114 --> 00:10:17.016
for potential wrongdoing.

00:10:17.016 --> 00:10:17.783
It's going to be interesting

00:10:17.783 --> 00:10:18.584
to see what happens.

00:10:18.584 --> 00:10:19.652
Right, and how serious

00:10:19.652 --> 00:10:21.187
these sanctions are.

00:10:21.187 --> 00:10:23.122
More than a year after this invasion.

00:10:23.122 --> 00:10:24.190
Thank you both so very much.

00:10:24.190 --> 00:10:24.957
I appreciate it.

